  [30 units]
)

#mcq(7, [Using the same figures, the average product of four workers is],
  [9 units],
  [36 units],
  [6 units],
  [8 units]
)

#mcq(8, [The law of diminishing returns states that, as more of a variable factor is added to a fixed factor,],
